<title>USA: Air Express splits stock, ups div.</title>
<headline>Air Express splits stock, ups div.</headline>
<dateline>DARIEN, Conn. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Express International said on Thursday that its board declared a three-for-two common stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be payable on July 25 to record holders on July 11, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company also declared a 25 percent increase in its quarterly dividend. The post-split dividend of $0.05 a share will be paid August 29 to shareholders of record on August 8.</p>
<p>The air freight forwarder added that after the split, it will have about 34.4 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
